---
---

<section
  class="py-14 md:py-16 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#0a0f1a] relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 md:mb-14">
      <span
        class="inline-block py-1.5 px-3 sm:py-2 sm:px-4 bg-constival-teal/10 dark:bg-constival-teal/30 text-constival-teal dark:text-constival-mint font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-badge mb-4 border-l-4 border-constival-teal dark:border-constival-mint"
      >
        Documentación Necesaria
      </span>
      <h2
        class="font-sans text-section-title font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white tracking-tight"
      >
        Requisitos para <span class="text-constival-mint">disolver su empresa en Ecuador.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-4 flex justify-center">
        <span
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans text-xs font-bold rounded-full"
        >
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg
          >
          Actualizado a Mayo 2026
        </span>
      </div>
      <p
        class="font-sans text-body text-constival-navy/70 dark:text-slate-400 mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
      >
        Todo lo demás lo hacemos nosotros. Sin papeleo innecesario ni gestiones presenciales ante la Superintendencia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-5">
      <!-- Req 1 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-5 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-constival-mint/30 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <div
          class="w-10 h-10 mb-3 flex items-center justify-center bg-constival-mint/10 dark:bg-constival-mint/20 text-constival-mint"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M10 6H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v9a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-5m-4 0V5a2 2 0 114 0v1m-4 0a2 2 0 104 0m-5 8a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4zm0 0c1.306 0 2.417.835 2.83 2M9 14a3.001 3.001 0 00-2.83 2M15 11h3m-3 4h2"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-sans font-bold text-feature-title text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
          RUC de la Empresa
        </h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-body text-constival-navy/70 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          RUC vigente de la empresa y certificado de inscripción en el Registro Mercantil o de Sociedades.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Req 2 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-5 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-constival-mint/30 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <div
          class="w-10 h-10 mb-3 flex items-center justify-center bg-constival-mint/10 dark:bg-constival-mint/20 text-constival-mint"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-sans font-bold text-feature-title text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
          Balance Final
        </h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-body text-constival-navy/70 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Último balance final de operaciones y cuadro de distribución del haber social firmado por contador y representante legal.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Req 3 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-5 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-constival-mint/30 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <div
          class="w-10 h-10 mb-3 flex items-center justify-center bg-constival-mint/10 dark:bg-constival-mint/20 text-constival-mint"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-sans font-bold text-feature-title text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
          Cédulas de Socios
        </h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-body text-constival-navy/70 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Cédulas de identidad o pasaportes de todos los socios y del representante legal de la empresa.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Req 4 -->
      <div
        class="group bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-5 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-constival-mint/30 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <div
          class="w-10 h-10 mb-3 flex items-center justify-center bg-constival-mint/10 dark:bg-constival-mint/20 text-constival-mint"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-sans font-bold text-feature-title text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
          Datos de Contacto
        </h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-body text-constival-navy/70 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Domicilios actualizados y correos electrónicos de todos los socios para notificaciones legales y del proceso.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Note card -->
    <div class="mt-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div
        class="group bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-5 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-constival-mint/30 transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-4"
      >
        <div
          class="w-10 h-10 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-constival-mint/10 dark:bg-constival-mint/20 text-constival-mint"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-sans font-bold text-feature-title text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-1">
            Nota sobre gastos adicionales
          </h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-body text-constival-navy/70 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Los honorarios listados corresponden exclusivamente a honorarios profesionales CONSTIVAL y <strong>no incluyen</strong> gastos notariales ni derechos de inscripción en el Registro Mercantil. Las S.A.S. generalmente no requieren escritura pública; las S.A. y Cía. Ltda. sí, lo que implica costos notariales adicionales que se detallan en la cotización inicial.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
